{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:711","content":{"id":711,"title":"最大子序和","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"72ffd233-8b66-4829-a801-263295224aa1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d5d4a06-5d1a-4dee-b777-0f4661d0ab4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，找到一个具有最大和的连续子数组（子数组最少包含一个元素），返回其最大和。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd9bc078-6ede-47bf-b35a-c0af77713672","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"2ee3c9b9-fcc6-4c54-a4bf-884906b49586","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e42a5fb2-9622-4ce0-8619-5e815156a51d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]\n输出：6\n解释：连续子数组 [4,-1,2,1] 的和最大，为 6 。","collabId":"094d29eb-2c09-4050-bcb3-b64e5a725493","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecad26a9-3e3a-4487-8cba-86f42d67c7c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"7f1ecce9-4170-4bcf-a6f4-4049bd5667ae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6d55ae43-5748-4d5d-bdfe-008a70603d1f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [1]\n输出：1","collabId":"211caa2e-0ccd-4d3a-8460-355e282443c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e18b5293-cba9-4ea7-8567-21580e9cefac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例3："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"2ed60149-efb9-4c52-8d8a-e0142b3ff74c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8565dedc-4e2e-45b8-b86f-4563c6b07181","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [-100000]\n输出：-100000","collabId":"0bfd5754-eb8e-4242-841f-379bf440296b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7429ab1b-6cb9-4365-a731-5a69bed1abf9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4d8059eb-f85a-45e2-8de0-75889003330c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"20b1e490-9731-42b8-90fc-3f82284e0346","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"319fdada-c1e0-4508-8165-6020a18d0837","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1 <= nums.length <= 3 * 10^4"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3c8f5bfe-42a3-4e70-8fa6-254a1e425661","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dcbd91d8-6521-44ea-b0c1-b01269c91055","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-10^5 <= nums[i] <= 10^5"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0244f7bf-5688-4b90-a504-f8b3248ad543","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目解析"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"960bc633-92c2-4c63-a5ba-29fdd2b021c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个很典型的动态规划的问题，我们定义一个数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，长度为输入数组的长度，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"num[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 结尾的最大子序列，我们可以得到如下更新公式"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{dp}[i]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\text{dp}[i-1] + \\text{nums}[i], & \\text{dp}[i - 1] > 0 \\\\\n\\text{nums}[i], & \\text{dp}[i-1] \\leq 0\n\\end{cases}","collabId":"c9d0f24b-c440-4ca1-bb93-0305760476c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76e5e139-16b8-44e5-87fd-0829a4ef8919","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以写出如下代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"e08fed91-5451-4849-9590-9313475094ff","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dd3b57cd-83e4-4a35-9cb9-8616cffd58ee","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {\n    int[] dp = new int[nums.length];\n    dp[0] = nums[0];\n    int max = dp[0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (dp[i - 1] < 0) {\n            dp[i] = nums[i];\n        } else {\n            dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + nums[i];\n        }\n\n        if (dp[i] > max) {\n            max = dp[i];\n        }\n    }\n\n    return max;\n}","collabId":"b4d0fc35-f893-44af-be3e-6c301a2a0426","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5bf38c16-9c04-4766-bb97-9bd13971920e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里还可以做一个小的优化，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只用到了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i -1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更早之前数据没有用到，所以我们不需要使用一个数组来保存数组，使用一个变量保存 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i - 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"3b8c6483-033f-4e82-b045-e9941c8a6bb0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"69cef3fa-3043-49b3-ae6f-69fc43ddacbf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {\n    int dp = nums[0];\n    int max = dp;\n    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (dp < 0) {\n            dp = nums[i];\n        } else {\n            dp = dp + nums[i];\n        }\n\n        if (dp > max) {\n            max = dp;\n        }\n    }\n\n    return max;\n}","collabId":"4434a9cb-1e12-4294-8ccf-c363c190f321","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ba7167a2-bd3a-4a3f-8609-e3b29473c20a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"96121ae4-4ccf-4103-9207-34136b4b5ea2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d9985ab0-e9b9-40b0-9adc-6c0b3d002a5d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"62887496-811f-4f94-a708-c85241abf180","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/maximum-subarray/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"85710326-1aeb-477c-b6b5-dd43e50847f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最大子序和"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"动态规划"},{"label":"最大子序和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:711","type":"doc","id":711}}],"prevPage":{"title":"跳跃游戏II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:704","type":"doc","id":704}},"nextPage":{"title":"最小路径和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:712","type":"doc","id":712}},"createTime":1729002477456,"updateTime":1744296689131,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296689131}}